   "name": "Ault – Cloverly 230/115 kV",
   "page": 1,
   "quote": "2. Ault – Cloverly 230/115 kV This project was previously referred to as the Northern Greeley Transmission Project. It consists of approximately 25 miles of new transmission, and two new substations in order to increase reliability, load-serving capability and resource accommodation northeast of the City of Greeley, Colorado.",
